{"recordId":"minister_班昭_2004111034","name":"班昭","type":"minister","dynasty":"東漢","title":"曹大家","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"班昭","pageId":2883,"revisionId":89378876,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-10-03T04:17:31Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8F%AD%E6%98%AD","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89378876","wikidataId":"Q177081","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"大汉王朝","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"Cite book","author":"王, 新龙","publisher":"青苹果数据中心","date":"2013","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"後漢書","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"汉书","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"大家赞","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:37:01.439Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:houhanshu","source:weishu","source:suishu","source:jinshi","source:songshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:houhanshu-dd8d4fc8cf08cc4a","query":"班昭","count":1,"offset":16791,"excerpt":"國也。〕是以班母一說，闔門辭事；〔太后兄大將軍隲，以母憂上書乞身，太后不許，以問班昭，乃許之。語見昭傳也。〕愛姪微愆，髡剔謝罪。〔太后兄隲子鳳受遺事洩，隲遂髡妻及鳳以謝天下。語見《隲傳》。〕將杜根逢誅，未值其誠乎！〔誠，信也。言未爲太后所信。〕","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:houhanshu-7aaa3c19c2d7db2c","query":"班昭","count":1,"offset":1414,"excerpt":"而見用，是為子違父而從婦，則罪在彼矣。生如此，亦何聊哉！」乃自殺。莫不傷之。\n\n班昭\n\n　　扶風曹世叔妻者，同郡班彪之女也，名昭，字惠班，一名姬。博學高才。世叔早卒，有節行法度。兄固著《漢書》，其八表及天文志未及竟而卒，和帝詔昭就東觀臧書閣踵而","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:weishu-77c7f429ddf701e2","query":"班昭","count":1,"offset":5780,"excerpt":"土，大啟河山，傳祚無窮，永同帶礪，實有始封之功，方成不遷之廟。但親在四世之內，名班昭穆之序，雖應為太祖，而尚在禰位，不可遠探高祖之父，以合五者之數。太祖之室，當須世世相推，親盡之後，乃出居正位，以備五廟之典。夫循文責實，理貴允當，考創宗祊，得禮","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:suishu-d249e9c5b9161b2c","query":"班昭","count":1,"offset":915,"excerpt":"中大夫《揚雄集》五卷\n\n漢太中大夫《劉歆集》五卷\n\n漢成帝《班婕妤集》一卷梁有《班昭集》三卷，王莽建新大尹《崔篆集》一卷，保成師友《唐林集》一卷，中謁者《史岑集》二卷，後漢《東平王蒼集》五卷，《桓譚集》五卷，亡。\n\n後漢司隸從事《馮衍集》五卷\n","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:jinshi-4a1a76b8163f8818","query":"班昭","count":1,"offset":9432,"excerpt":"，不知所終。\n\n　　贊曰：《周禮》「九嬪，掌婦學之法，婦德、婦言、婦容、婦功。」班昭氏論之曰：「婦德，不必才明絕異也。婦言，不必便口利辭也。婦容，不必顏色美麗也。婦功，不必功巧過人也。清閒貞靜，守節整齊，行己有恥，動靜有法，是謂婦德。擇辭而說，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-52f5f2fd5e1ed925","query":"班昭","count":1,"offset":9443,"excerpt":"記\n\n劉向《古列女傳》九卷《漢武內傳》二卷〔（不知作者）〕\n\n郭憲《洞冥記》四卷班昭《女戒》一卷伶玄《趙飛燕外傳》一卷皇甫謐《高士傳》十卷\n\n袁宏《正始名士傳》二卷葛洪《西京雜記》六卷習鑿齒《襄陽耆舊記》五卷蕭韶《太清紀》十卷\n\n杜寶《大業雜記","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":6,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:houhanshu-dd8d4fc8cf08cc4a","bookId":"book:houhanshu","requestedTitle":"後漢書/卷10上","title":"後漢書/卷10上","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%BE%8C%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B710%E4%B8%8A","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=8737760","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%BE%8C%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B710%E4%B8%8A?action=history","revisionId":8737760,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-28T06:27:41Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:37:04.761Z","sha256":"2704d36cf6a11af9599e259603dba0ac330a092235df35061c36baa4795d396f","textSha256":"3a9e9a0dbd5e095b18da86f5b27dec63d6a2dfb173732a45887fe97b1ba9074a","expandedWikitextSha256":"2704d36cf6a11af9599e259603dba0ac330a092235df35061c36baa4795d396f","characters":16950,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/houhanshu.json","status":"downloaded","ac